        {
          "ruleId": "staleness-below-heartbeat",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Asset WBTC on arbitrum accepts answers up to 3,600 seconds (1 hour) old, shorter than the heartbeat of its feed, 86,400 seconds (24 hours). In a calm market the feed is written only when the heartbeat runs out, and the round can reach the chain a little after it, so reads revert for part of every heartbeat and liquidations and repayments stop with them. Fix: Set maxStaleness above the heartbeat of the feed on this network, with room for the delay before a round reaches the chain."
          },
          "locations": [
