            "text": "Asset ARB on arbitrum has no maxPrice, so an answer far outside any price the asset can have is used as it is. On most feeds minAnswer and maxAnswer no longer stop such an answer; the Chainlink pages leave the limits to the application. Fix: Give the asset a minPrice above 0 and a maxPrice that the price of the asset should never reach, and pause or fall back on an answer outside them."
